# Normalize line endings: text files get LF in the repository; the
# working-tree checkout follows each developer machine core.autocrlf
# setting. Kills the CRLF "illusion diffs" (files show as modified with
# zero content changes) that polluted git status after Windows checkouts.
* text=auto

# Windows batch scripts MUST keep CRLF in the working tree — cmd.exe
# chokes on LF-only .bat files, so pin them regardless of autocrlf.
*.bat text eol=crlf
